flowchart TD
  A([Start]) --> B[Open title screen]
  B --> C[Open match setup]
  C --> D[Select grid and player count]
  D --> E[Start match]
  E --> F[Select cell]
  F --> G{Legal move?}
  G -->|No| H[Show rejection]
  H --> F
  G -->|Yes| I[Resolve pure rules]
  I --> J{Cascade?}
  J -->|Yes| K[Show preview and lock input]
  K --> L[Commit settled board]
  J -->|No| L
  L --> M{Winner?}
  M -->|Yes| N[Announce winner]
  M -->|No| O[Advance player]
  O --> F
  N --> P([Reset or close])
